<AddOnInstructionDefinition Name="TimeCues" Revision="1.0" ExecutePrescan="false" ExecutePostscan="false" ExecuteEnableInFalse="false" CreatedDate="2026-11-19T22:57:21.557Z" CreatedBy="ICCMS\igober01" EditedDate="2026-11-19T23:04:35.198Z" EditedBy="ICCMS\igober01" SoftwareRevision="v36.03">
<Description>
<![CDATA[One-scan cues when an elapsed time passes fixed points from 10 ms to 10 s, for timed sequences and test timelines.]]>
</Description>
<Parameters>
