<Tag Name="TestMode" TagType="Base" DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Constant="false" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Value / 100 = DriveType, last two digits = case, 0 = idle. A new value applies its preset and pulses Reset. 1: at pos 0. 2: move to pos 1. 3: timeout. 4: timeout, DeactivateOnFault. 5: Reset retry. 6: Reset, then arrive. 7: Cmd change restarts timer. 8: lost position. 9: both sensors on. 10: sensor fault Reset. 11: Cmd 2. 12: Cmd 5. 13: TimeoutTo0 -1. 14: TimeoutTo1 -1. 101-110: 1-10, DriveType 1. 111: Cmd 2. 201: Cmd 2 stop. 202: stop, Cmd 1. 203: timeout. 212: Cmd 5. 901: DriveType -1. 902: DriveType 3.]]>
</Description>
<Data Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</Data>
<Data Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</Data>
</Tag>
<Tag Name="TestModeStorage" TagType="Base" DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Constant="false" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Data Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</Data>
<Data Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</Data>
</Tag>
